== 9. Verdict against the pre-set criterion ==================== 
  CONFIRMS LEE = detection rises across quintiles, top >= 2x bottom, 
                 with donor-level support 
  CONTRADICTS  = detection falls across quintiles 
  NULL         = flat, or not surviving depth matching 
 
  NULL -- no gradient along the differentiation axis 
    bottom quintile 7.26% -> top quintile 9.22% (1.27x), trend p = 0.955 
    monotonic increase across all five quintiles: no 
 
  WHAT THIS CANNOT SAY: detection of a transcript is not protein 
  localisation. Lee's evidence is immunostaining; this is mRNA in 
  dissociated cells. Agreement across those two measurements is 
  meaningful, but this does not reproduce his experiment. 

